msgid "Settings → Claude → sign in. It runs the official claude setup-token inside the utility container, so nothing is installed here; paste the code that page gives you back into the input and it is stored. Good for a year."
msgstr "设置 → Claude → 登录。它在工具容器里跑官方的 claude setup-token，本机什么都不用装；把那个页面给你的码粘回输入框就存下了。管一年。"

msgid "Settings → codex → sign in, which runs the official device-code flow; codex is not installed here. Pasting an API key works too."
msgstr "设置 → codex → 登录，走的是官方的 device-code 流程；本机没装 codex。粘一个 API key 也行。"

msgid "Settings: account, environment, skills, theme, and this project's gates and sandbox ⌘S"
msgstr "设置：账号、环境、技能、主题，以及这个项目的闸门和沙箱 ⌘S"

