msgstr "展开另外 {restCount} 个（{restCeiling}）"

msgid "showing {span}"
msgstr "看的是 {span}"

msgid "Silence this long and the group is asked what it is doing. Not a failure — a long compile is silent too — so this is hours rather than minutes."
msgstr "沉默这么久，就会去问这个组在干什么。不是失败——编译很久也是沉默的——所以这里是小时而不是分钟。"

msgid "Skills"
msgstr "技能"

msgid "Skills are mounted but the directory inside is empty: host {hostPath} has {onHost}, and {at} in the container has 0.\n"
"The container runtime cannot read that host path, so binding it delivers an empty directory — on macOS docker runs inside a VM, and paths outside it (/var/tmp and the like) are never shared in. Point skillsDir at a location that is shared ($HOME works), add it to opensandbox-server's allowed_host_paths, and restart it. Until then agents have no skills at all."
msgstr "技能目录挂上了，但容器里是空的：宿主机 {hostPath} 有 {onHost} 个，容器里的 {at} 有 0 个。\n"
"容器运行时读不到那个宿主路径，绑上去只会得到一个空目录 —— macOS 上 docker 跑在虚拟机里，虚拟机外的路径（/var/tmp 之类）从来不会共享进去。把 skillsDir 指到一个能共享的位置（$HOME 就行），加进 opensandbox-server 的 allowed_host_paths，然后重启它。在那之前 agent 一个技能都没有。"

msgid "Skills are not mounted into the sandbox: opensandbox-server's allowed_host_paths does not list {path}. Add it and reopen this group's container; until then agents can only use the skills named in the input box."
msgstr "技能没挂进沙箱：opensandbox-server 的 allowed_host_paths 里没有 {path}。加进去并重开这个工单的容器；在那之前 agent 只能用输入框里点名的技能。"

