msgid "Steps one turn may take before it is cut off. Most turns finish in about 36; the long tail is an agent lost rather than working, and it costs the most because every step re-reads the transcript. Changing it restarts every session."
msgstr "一个 turn 最多走多少步就掐断。多数 turn 三十几步就完事；长尾是 agent 迷路了而不是在干活，而且最贵——每一步都要重读整份记录。改这一项会重启所有 session。"

msgid "still not up after {secs}s"
msgstr "等了 {secs} 秒还没起来"

